  _interactAudio: {fileID: 0}
  _phoneDialogue:
    _sentences:
    - "Hey honey, \nDid you take pics of everything I asked? "
    - Good job pal! But now that I think of it, there's plenty more junk to sell...
    - 'You know what? I''ve got my hands full with these two anyway - why don''t
      you just stay the night there? '
    - Go on downstairs and watch a bit of TV before before bed. It'll help you relax,
      pal. Pomise.
  _phoneDialogueMorning:
    _sentences:
    - Hey sleepyhead, good morning - or should I say afternoon!
    - I took your brother and sister to check out the new place - I would have woken
      you, but you were sleeping so well...
    - Anyways, We're just settling in and unpacking a few boxes. I'll come pick you
      up tonight, but can you do me a favor first?
    - 'We need pictures of anything we want to sell online - no use cluttering up
      the new place, especially before your big day! '
    - Time goes by so fast...
    - 'Anyways, I left my old camcorder downstairs on the kitchen table - you can
      use that to to take the pics. '
    - Think of this like a chance to say goodybe to everything. I'll give you a call
      later to check up - good luck sweetheart!
